       the table's (VOUT(typ) + 1 V), 6.0 V: closed from 8.28 V, tripped from 10.45 V
       record l9stk's 9.68 V is the tripped figure on its criterion (this record: 9.68 V): REPRODUCED. Closed (the state that trips) the
